<title>USA: Detrex to sell industrial furnace division.</title>
<headline>Detrex to sell industrial furnace division.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHFIELD, Mich. 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Detrex Corp said Monday it had agreed to sell all of the assets and certain liabilites of its Pacific Industrial Furnace Co division to Atmosphere Furnace Co, which builds and services heat treating equipment.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Detrex is a divcersified specialty chemical company.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
